### WebSocket STOMP test for Deep Research
# Note: The IntelliJ HTTP Client doesn't natively speak STOMP protocol yet in the WEBSOCKET tool.
# STOMP requires a specific framing (CONNECT, SUBSCRIBE, SEND frames).
# Below is the raw STOMP frame sequence for testing.

WEBSOCKET ws://localhost:8081/ws-research/websocket
Content-Type: application/json

===
CONNECT
accept-version:1.2,1.1,1.0
heart-beat:10000,10000

^@
=== wait-for-server
===
SUBSCRIBE
id:sub-0
destination:/topic/research/progress

^@
===
SUBSCRIBE
id:sub-1
destination:/topic/research/result

^@
===
SEND
destination:/app/research
content-type:application/json

{"researchTopic": "What are the latest Java AI application frameworks"}
^@
=== wait-for-server
###
